{"id":"rang","lemma":"rang","pos":"noun","rank":2272,"glosses":["row or line of things placed side-by-side","rank or position in a series or hierarchy","a knitting course"],"ipa":"/ʁɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8f/Fr-rang.ogg/Fr-rang.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"rangs"},"formAudio":{"rangs":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/92/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-rangs.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Elle est au premier rang.","en":"She is first in line.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"first"},null]},{"text":"Il tient le rang de colonel.","en":"He holds the rank of colonel.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to have","l":"tenir"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a colonel"}]},{"text":"Pourquoi vous mettez-vous en rang ?","en":"What are you lining up for?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to put","l":"mettre"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"in / of it"},null]},{"text":"Nous avons perdu trois jeux dans un rang.","en":"We've lost three games in a row.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"lost"},{"g":"three"},{"g":"game","l":"jeu"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"J'ai déjà un acheteur sur les rangs.","en":"I've already got a buyer lined up.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"already, before"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"buyer, purchaser"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]}]}